=== Keyboard Shortcuts ===
── Navigation ──
  ↑/k                 Move up in the list, chat, menu or help
  ↓/j                 Move down in the list, chat, menu or help
  PgUp                Move up one page
  PgDn                Move down one page
  Home/g              Go to the top
  End/G               Go to the end; in the chat, back to live
  Enter               Open the highlighted item
  Tab                 Switch between the list and the chat
  Esc                 Go back one level; from a search, to where it began
  Ctrl+R              Back to categories from anywhere
  f                   Favorite the channel or pin the category; again to undo
── Search and filters ──
  /                   Filter the list
  Ctrl+F/S            Search categories and channels
  l                   Open the language and audience filters
  In the search prompt:
    Enter Ctrl+F/S    Search for what you typed
    Esc               Cancel the search
  In the / filter:
    ↑/↓ PgUp PgDn     Move through the list while typing
